# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for B&R Automation Studio projects
# Based on community-verified patterns (br-automation.com forum,
# toptal.com/developers/gitignore, github.com/bee-eater/AS-gitignore)
#
# Only version the actual source: the .apj project file plus the
# Logical/ and Physical/ folders. Everything below is generated
# automatically by Automation Studio on open/compile/transfer and
# should never be committed.
# =====================================================================

# AR system files pulled in per-project (not part of your source)
/AS/System/
**/AS/System/

# Build output — fully regenerated on every compile
/Binaries/
**/Binaries/

# Temporary working files created when the project is opened
/Temp/
**/Temp/

# Debug/Watch window configuration (local to a dev machine)
/Diagnosis/
**/Diagnosis/

# Temporary safety-application files (SafeDESIGNER / safety CPUs)
/Physical/*/*/*/DLFiles/
**/DLFiles/

# AS component upgrade packages — not part of source code
/Upgrades/
**/Upgrades/

# Per-user settings and "is this project already open" lock markers
*.set
*.isopen

# Logs
/debug.log
/ConvertLog.txt

# Packed/exported project archives (re-export instead of committing)
*.zip

# OS / editor noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
